{"artifact_id":"Figure2","kind":"figure","asset_path":"figures/fig_2606.11182v1-Figure2-1-147d59a7c38b.png","asset_sha256":"147d59a7c38b0d9dfe82c3563172ed27c3006d26b8d646df02db7243a1822eb3","source_pdf_sha256":"796f3e04db798f9440b33c43cddd15e562fe1980ae64dc6fae3921a25590f105","revision_vid":"0a909f74d2d249aeb21052eea43491be943c926d139499b2c26c8cdb181a3cf7","canonical_id":"2606.11182","section_vid":"82a948b76efda7cba4f3c6432ab84c8ca6558afbc88874c88e489153e6aa0a3c","detector_fingerprint":"pdffigures2-0.0.12-SNAPSHOT","detector_metadata_sha256":"ec1f5abbb08247424229907ee22e266dbc98411d1d20c017e69c71fd8194b9f2","page_index":2,"region":{"x1":60.0,"y1":369.6,"x2":551.04,"y2":553.4399999999999},"caption":"Figure 2: Main framework of Eevee. Inference routes each input to a specialized prompt; learning co-evolves the router and prompt set through mutation, analysis, reflection, scoring, and regrouping.","containing_section":{"relation":"containing","section_id":"sec-1~10","path_id":"1~10","title":"Router Evolution Prompt Evolution","text":"Figure 2: Main framework of Eevee. Inference routes each input to a specialized prompt; learning co-evolves the router and prompt set through mutation, analysis, reflection, scoring, and regrouping.","truncated":false,"section_ordinal":13},"neighboring_sections":[{"relation":"previous","section_id":"sec-1~9","path_id":"1~9","title":"Add","text":"","truncated":false,"section_ordinal":12},{"relation":"next","section_id":"sec-2.2.","path_id":"2.2.","title":"Router-Prompt Co-evolution","text":"The mixed adaptation data is split into training and validation sets, D tr and D val . Each co-evolution cycle alternates two operations: router evolution fixes the prompt set and searches for a better router, then prompt evolution fixes this router and updates each slot prompt on its routed data. Write P T = {p k,T } K k=1 . In a cycle starting from R T and P T , R T+1 = RouterEvolve(R T ; P T , D tr , D val ), P T+1 = P T ,P T+2 = {︁ PromptEvolve(p k,T+1 ; R T+1 , D T+1 tr,k , D T+1 val,k ) }︁ K k=1 , R T+2 = R T+1 .The next router phase uses the updated prompt set, so routing decisions and prompt specialization improve each other rather than being optimized in isolation. Router candidates are scored by downstream accuracy, consistency, and balance. Let a R (x, y) = 1[M(x; p R(x;P T ) ) = y] denote routed correctness under R and the fixed prompt set:S R (R) = λ acc A(R) + λ con C(R) + λ bal B(R), A(R) = 1 |D val | ∑︀ (x,y)∈D val a R (x, y), C(R) = β in Compact(R) + β out Separate(R), B(R) = γ use |K R | K + γ bal Balance(π R ).Here K R is the set of labels used by R and π R is its empirical label distribution. Compact rewards same-label examples with similar cached correctness vectors, while Separate rewards behaviorally distinguishable labels. The weights are annealed from consistency/balance toward downstream accuracy. Appendix B.1 shows that performance is stable across alternative annealing, weighting, and prompt-search settings. Best Router Training Data (Q&amp;A Pairs","truncated":true,"section_ordinal":14}],"reference_excerpts":[{"section_id":"sec-1~10","path_id":"1~10","title":"Router Evolution Prompt Evolution","matched_form":"figure 2","excerpt":"Figure 2: Main framework of Eevee. Inference routes each input to a specialized prompt; learning co-evolves the router and prompt set through mutation, analysis, reflection, scoring, and regrouping.","truncated":false}],"article_summary":{"source_id":"grobid:2606.11182#abstract","source_text_sha256":"2c104c0238f167fdb99e9545da61ce0d1f09aaf3e6b7f2fbfa7e3f237f582b3c","text":"Website CodeIn this paper, we propose Eevee, the first multi-dataset test-time prompt learning framework for LLM agents, enabling test-time prompt learning under real-world task streams. Existing methods are largely designed for single-dataset settings, while real-world applications require models to handle heterogeneous input streams drawn from multiple datasets, domains, and task distributions, limiting their practical applicability. To mitigate cross-dataset interference, Eevee introduces a router that partitions incoming inputs into task clusters and assigns them to suitable prompt configurations. This design is optimized via a router-prompt co-evolution strategy, which employs interleaved router and prompt learning phases to address their mutual dependency. Experiments across multiple datasets demonstrate that the framework improves robustness under heterogeneous data streams while maintaining single-benchmark learning capability and efficiency. Specifically, Eevee improves average multi-benchmark scores by 10.38 and 24.32 points over Qwen3-4B-Instruct and DeepSeek-V3.2, surpassing SOTA methods GEPA and ACE by up to 37.2% and 48.2%.","truncated":false},"diagnostics":["neighbor_section_truncated:2.2."],"total_context_chars":3249,"truncated":true}